{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marbies Party</strong> is a chaotic local <strong>party game</strong> playable <strong>up to\u00a04</strong>, in which you play as silly little rounded characters running around mazes. Get in your opponents' way as you play a variety of game modes all the way to victory! <br>(\u01dd\u0279o\u026f s\u1d09 \u01dd\u0279\u01dd\u0265\u0287 \u0287nq)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUN AND CHAOS WITH FRIENDS \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players, locally or online using <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/e1b9c0636a9a6156d50eb0615be2856f.poster.avif?t=1759880004\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/e1b9c0636a9a6156d50eb0615be2856f.webp?t=1759880004\" class=\"bb_img\" width=780 height=240 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique Marbie before jumping in!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PROCEDURALLY GENERATED MAZES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/cb5b20bb4c32fa385eb8e5653b100b27.poster.avif?t=1759880004\" width=780 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/cb5b20bb4c32fa385eb8e5653b100b27.webm?t=1759880004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new maze is generated each time you play: every game is unique!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VARIOUS THEMES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5 *</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a selection of themes to change the scenery, or leave it to chance!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FRIENDS IN A VARIETY OF GAME MODES \u25d5\u203f\u25d5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COINS RUSH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/83c8c14f5174f799f5e7bc449ff4f488.poster.avif?t=1759880004\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/83c8c14f5174f799f5e7bc449ff4f488.webm?t=1759880004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect as many coins as possible and jump into the hole at the center of the maze to score them. Smash crates to obtain unique power-ups that will help you beat your opponents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/77808d10f26109ca8cf88fe5553eaadf.poster.avif?t=1759880004\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/77808d10f26109ca8cf88fe5553eaadf.webm?t=1759880004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the other end of the maze before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLINDFOLDED *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find your way in the dark before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAYHEM *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life in the maze and hit as many opponents as you can to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE ROYALE *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last Marbie standing wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARBALL *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically play football... except <i>you</i> are the ball. Score as many points as you can to beat the other team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAWING *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reproduce the picture as best you can by rolling in the snow. The most accurate artist wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKILL *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll you way to the opposite side of the maze without falling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >T\u0300\u0311\u0344\u0346\u0346\u0315\u0312\u0305\u0351\u0360\u035f\u032b\u0330\u0332\u0324\u03620\u0340\u0344\u0305\u030b\u034b\u0312\u030b\u0322\u0320\u032a\u032e\u0320\u031e5\u0306\u0309\u0352\u0361\u033f\u0357\u033d\u030a\u0326\u0339\u0321\u0348\u0331\u0345\u0316\u0356\u0331F\u0307\u034b\u0313\u033e\u035b\u0357\u034b\u0339\u0353\u032b\u031d\u033c\u031e\u032e\u0345\u031c\u033b\u0338I\u030e\u030c\u030d\u0312\u033d\u0351\u031f\u031f\u034d\u033c\u0354\u033a\u0330\u0348\u0355\u0323E\u0352\u031a\u0314\u0314\u031a\u0343\u0358\u033c\u032b\u0329\u033b\u033b\u031c\u034d\u0322\u03491\u0314\u0304\u0302\u0301\u0350\u0342\u0310\u0320\u032a\u032b\u035c\u034e\u0316\u0354\u0320\u0334P\u0351\u030c\u035e\u0342\u030e\u0330\u0326\u0339\u0325\u0320\u0348\u0362\u032cU\u0341\u0300\u033f\u0344\u030a\u033d\u0323\u0317\u031c\u0362\u0327\u0325\u0338k\u033f\u0311\u0305\u0312\u030e\u034b\u0357\u0351\u034a\u0309\u035a\u0324\u0330\u0316\u0323\u0318\u0337U\u030e\u0343\u030f\u030f\u0342\u031b\u0310\u0314\u033c\u0330\u0331\u032a\u0322\u0347\u0316g\u030e\u0340\u0315\u031b\u0360\u0340\u0315\u0347\u032a\u035f\u0354\u033b\u034d\u0354\u0334V\u