sinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/77808d10f26109ca8cf88fe5553eaadf.poster.avif?t=1759880004\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3648320/extras/77808d10f26109ca8cf88fe5553eaadf.webm?t=1759880004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the other end of the maze before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLINDFOLDED *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to find your way in the dark before your opponents to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAYHEM *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for your life in the maze and hit as many opponents as you can to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BATTLE ROYALE *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last Marbie standing wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MARBALL *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically play football... except <i>you</i> are the ball. Score as many points as you can to beat the other team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAWING *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reproduce the picture as best you can by rolling in the snow. The most accurate artist wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKILL *</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll you way to the opposite side of the maze without falling!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >T\u0300\u0311\u0344\u0346\u0346\u0315\u0312\u0305\u0351\u0360\u035f\u032b\u0330\u0332\u0324\u03620\u0340\u0344\u0305\u030b\u034b\u0312\u030b\u0322\u0320\u032a\u032e\u0320\u031e5\u0306\u0309\u0352\u0361\u033f\u0357\u033d\u030a\u0326\u0339\u0321\u0348\u0331\u0345\u0316\u0356\u0331F\u0307\u034b\u0313\u033e\u035b\u0357\u034b